---
// Features.astro — Fitur Lengkap AIdah
---

<section class="features" id="fitur">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Kemampuan Aplikasi</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Semua yang kamu butuhkan, <span class="highlight-inline">tanpa menu berbelit</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Fokus pada hal penting: tahu sisa uangmu, mengontrol pengeluaran, dan mencapai target tabungan tanpa ribet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <!-- Feature 1: Chat Parser (Primary Feature) -->
      <div class="feature-card feature-primary">
        <div class="feature-badge-top">Fitur Utama</div>
        <div class="feature-header-row">
          <div class="feature-icon-box">💬</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Pencatat Transaksi Berbasis Bahasa Manusia</h3>
            <p class="feature-subtitle">Nemo AI mengerti bahasa percakapan sehari-hari orang Indonesia tanpa perlu format kaku.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-example-box">
          <div class="example-item">
            <span class="example-in">"beli bensin 50rb"</span>
            <span class="example-arrow">➔</span>
            <span class="example-out">🛵 Transportasi • -Rp 50.000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="example-item">
            <span class="example-in">"kopi kenangan 24k"</span>
            <span class="example-arrow">➔</span>
            <span class="example-out">🍱 Makan & Minum • -Rp 24.000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="example-item">
            <span class="example-in">"gaji freelance 3.5jt"</span>
            <span class="example-arrow">➔</span>
            <span class="example-out">💰 Pemasukan Gaji • +Rp 3.500.000</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Multimodal Receipt Scanner -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">📸</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Pindai Struk Belanja Otomatis</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Malas ketik belanjaan supermarket yang panjang? Cukup foto struk kasir atau nota belanjaanmu. Vision AI langsung membaca total nominal, merchant, dan itemnya secara instan.
        </p>
        <div class="mini-receipt-preview">
          <div class="receipt-item-row">
            <span>🛒 Indomaret / Alfamart</span>
            <span class="badge-tag">Terdeteksi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-amount-row">
            <span>Total Belanja:</span>
            <span class="receipt-price">-Rp 138.500</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Daily Reminders with Nemo Bubble Chime -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">🔔</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Pengingat Harian (Nemo Chime)</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Nemo akan mengingatkanmu 3x sehari dengan nada dering khas gelembung <i>Nemo Bubble</i>: sapaan inspirasi pagi (08:00), istirahat siang (12:00), dan rekap sebelum lelap (20:00).
        </p>
        <div class="mini-reminder-preview">
          <div class="reminder-time-badge">⏰ 08:00 • 12:00 • 20:00 WIB</div>
          <div class="reminder-quote">"Nemo akan mengingatkanmu betapa pentingnya mencatat hal yang dianggap kecil itu."</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Budget Progress -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">🎯</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Budget Anti-Bocor & Custom Pos</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Beri batas anggaran per pos pengeluaran. Kamu juga bebas membuat kategori baru dengan emoji pilihanmu. AI langsung memperingatkan saat pos belanja mendekati batas limit.
        </p>
        <div class="mini-progress-preview">
          <div class="progress-labels">
            <span>🍱 Makan & Minum</span>
            <span class="progress-percent">75% terpakai</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-bar-bg">
            <div class="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 75%;"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-meta">Rp 375.000 / Rp 500.000</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5: Dream Goals -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">⭐</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Tabungan Impian (Dreams)</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Punya target beli gadget, liburan, atau dana darurat? Tetapkan nominal target dan tanggal tercapai. Alokasikan saldo otomatis dari setiap rezeki atau gaji masuk.
        </p>
        <div class="mini-goal-preview">
          <div class="goal-icon">💻</div>
          <div class="goal-info">
            <div class="goal-name">Upgrade Laptop Kerja</div>
            <div class="goal-amount">Rp 6.000.000 / Rp 12.000.000 (50%)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6: Filter Waktu & Ekspor CSV -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">📊</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Filter Cepat & Ekspor Laporan</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Ketahui pengeluaranmu secara instan lewat filter tombol cepat: <b>Hari Ini</b>, <b>7 Hari Terakhir</b>, atau <b>Bulan Ini</b>. Ekspor seluruh rekapan ke format CSV untuk Excel atau dibagikan ke WhatsApp.
        </p>
        <div class="mini-filter-preview">
          <span class="filter-pill active">Hari Ini</span>
          <span class="filter-pill">7 Hari</span>
          <span class="filter-pill">Bulan Ini</span>
          <span class="filter-pill">Semua</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 7: Privasi & Keamanan Maksimal -->
      <div class="feature-card feature-wide">
        <div class="feature-header-row">
          <div class="feature-icon-box">🔒</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Privasi & Keamanan Berlapis</h3>
            <p class="feature-subtitle">Keamanan data keuanganmu adalah prioritas mutlak yang terisolasi penuh.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="feature-desc">
          Dilengkapi proteksi <b>PIN 4-digit</b>, autentikasi <b>sensor sidik jari / Face ID</b> lokal, validasi password kuat real-time, dan isolasi database PostgreSQL dengan <i>Row Level Security (RLS)</i>. Data finansialmu tidak pernah dijual atau diserahkan ke pihak ketiga.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .section-container {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #DBEAFE;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--blue-800);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .highlight-inline {
    background: #FEF08A;
    padding: 0 6px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .section-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #475569;
    font-weight: 600;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 28px 24px;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .feature-primary {
    grid-column: span 3;
    background: #EFF6FF;
    position: relative;
  }
  .feature-wide {
    grid-column: span 3;
    background: #F8FAFC;
  }
  .feature-badge-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 20px;
    background: var(--blue-500);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 99px;
  }
  .feature-header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .feature-icon-box {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .feature-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .feature-subtitle {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #475569;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .feature-example-box {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .example-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .example-in {
    background: #EFF6FF;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--blue-800);
  }
  .example-arrow {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .example-out {
    background: #DCFCE7;
    border: 1.5px solid #86EFAC;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #166534;
  }

  /* Receipt preview */
  .mini-receipt-preview {
    margin-top: auto;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
  }
  .receipt-item-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .badge-tag {
    background: #DBEAFE;
    color: #1D4ED8;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .receipt-amount-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #64748B;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .receipt-price {
    color: #DC2626;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* Reminder preview */
  .mini-reminder-preview {
    margin-top: auto;
    background: #EFF6FF;
    border: 1.5px solid #BFDBFE;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
  }
  .reminder-time-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1D4ED8;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .reminder-quote {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #1E3A5F;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Mini progress bar preview */
  .mini-progress-preview {
    margin-top: auto;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
  }
  .progress-labels {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .progress-percent {
    color: #DC2626;
  }
  .progress-bar-bg {
    height: 10px;
    background: #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 5px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .progress-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: #F87171;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .progress-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748B;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Mini goal preview */
  .mini-goal-preview {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
  }
  .goal-icon {
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .goal-name {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .goal-amount {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--blue-700);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Filter preview */
  .mini-filter-preview {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px;
  }
  .filter-pill {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid #CBD5E1;
    color: #64748B;
  }
  .filter-pill.active {
    background: var(--blue-500);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .features {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }
    .section-container {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      padding: 24px 18px;
      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink);
    }
    .feature-primary, .feature-wide {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .feature-card {
      padding: 20px 16px;
    }
    .feature-badge-top {
      position: static;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      align-self: flex-start;
    }
    .feature-header-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .feature-title {
      font-size: 16.5px;
    }
    .example-item {
      font-size: 12px;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .example-in, .example-out {
      word-break: break-word;
    }
  }
</style>
